coder › Implemented `retry` in `src/retry.ts` on branch `work/retry`.

What changed:
- `src/retry.ts`: validates `attempts < 1` with `RangeError` before running `fn`; loops up to `attempts` times returning the first success; between attempts awaits `sleep(baseMs * 2 ** (attempt - 1))` (so baseMs, 2x, 4x, …); after the last failure throws `Error('gave up after N attempts: <last message>', { cause: lastError })`. `sleep` defaults to a real `setTimeout` wait.
